    <iconUrl>https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Marfusios/websocket-client/master/src/Websocket.Client/icon-modern.png</iconUrl>
    <description>Client for websocket API with built-in reconnection and error handling</description>
    <releaseNotes>Add .NET Standard 2.0 support for full .NET Framework consumers and update the .NET Framework sample.</releaseNotes>
